flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Find a way into the server room and steal the game studio&#39;s source code."])
 _A1_(["Imitator and Pickpocket exit the elevator carrying stacks of pizza boxes."])
 _A1_1_(["A security officer immediately confronts Imitator to check the order."])
 _A1_C1_{"Imitator begs the guard to let him through, claiming the order is already late."}
 _A1_C1P_["The guard opens the top box, finds a Hawaiian pizza, and waves them through."]
 _A2_(["Imitator and Pickpocket enter the dev room with the pizza."])
 _A2_1_(["Imitator places the boxes on the desk and the game developers pile in."])
 _A2_2_(["As they&#39;re eating, Imitator surprises them with a demand for payment."])
 _A2_C1_{"Pickpocket tries to pickpocket a security fob while the devs figure out who&#39;s paying."}
 _A2_C1P_["Pickpocket manages to unclip a security key fob from an overweight gentleman."]
 _A3_(["With access to the server room acquired, they leave the devs to enjoy the pizza."])
 _A3_1_(["Hiding in the conference suite, Imitator tells the others to join them."])
 _A3_2_(["Having gained access to the stairwell, Hacker and Techie reach the fire exit."])
 _A3_3_(["Pickpocket notices the door is alarmed and the security office is only a few feet away."])
 _A3_4_(["Imitator positions himself to intercept the guards."])
 _A3_C1_{"Pickpocket opens the fire door as Imitator gets ready to act."}
 _A3_C1F_["Pickpocket ushers the team through but Imitator is apprehended."]
 _A3_5_(["Imitator apologizes for setting the alarm off, but the guards don&#39;t buy his explanation."])
 _A3_C2_{"Imitator starts crying and begs security not to call his boss."}
 _A3_C2F_["The guards drag Imitator into the office to interrogate him."]
 _A3_6_(["Seeing Imitator in trouble, the others rush over to help."])
 _A3_C3_{"Pickpocket tries to pickpocket the guard&#39;s pepper spray while he is distracted."}
 _A3_C3P_["Pickpocket grabs the spray and fires a burst into the eyes of both guards."]
 _A3_8_(["The others pile in and subdue the blinded brutes, knocking them out quickly and quietly."])
 _A3_9_(["Leaving the guards slumped in their office, the crew continues with its mission."])
 _A4_2_(["Pickpocket accompanies Techie to the server room to locate the code repository."])
 _A4_3_(["Meanwhile, Imitator helps Hacker find a quiet terminal to prepare for the breach."])
 _A4_4_(["Entering the server room, Pickpocket spots a technician working late."])
 _A4_C1_{"After identifying the right server, Techie tries to attach the wireless dongle discreetly."}
 _A4_C1P_["Techie tucks the dongle into an unused USB slot beneath the cable nest."]
 _A5_(["Hacker connects to the dongle from his terminal while Imitator keeps watch."])
 _A5_C1_{"Hacker injects a tunneling virus into the code repository server."}
 _A5_C1F_["Hacker is locked out mid-transfer as the system severs the wireless link."]
 _A5_1_(["Techie is called and told to move the dongle to another port."])
 _A5_C2_{"With the dongle seated inside another slot, Hacker tries to deploy the virus once more."}
 _A5_C2F_["Again, the system detects Hacker&#39;s intrusion, locking him out of the terminal."]
 _A5_2_(["Hacker gives up, grabs a portable hard drive, and heads to the server room."])
 _A5_3_(["When Pickpocket lets them in, the technician becomes irate and asks what&#39;s happening."])
 _A5_C3_{"Imitator and Hacker improvise a technical reason for their presence."}
 _A5_C3P_["Imitator convinces the techie they&#39;re specialists attending to a serious power issue."]
 _B6_(["Hacker asks him to go and fetch a grounding strap, pronto!"])
 _B6_C1_{"With the coast clear, Hacker tries to deploy the tunneling virus directly."}
 _B6_C1P_["Hacker launches the virus and gains access to the lower-level directories."]
 _B7_(["Techie connects the portable drive and the source code is downloaded."])
 _B7_1_(["Imitator and Pickpocket pull the server apart, shattering the storage modules one by one."])
 _B7_2_(["The team leaves the server room to exit, unaware that some drives remain intact."])
 _B7S_(["They vanish from the scene with half the code still in the company’s hands."])
 _A1_C1F_["The guard snorts, claiming it&#39;s not her problem."]
 _A1_2_(["She asks Imitator for the name of the person who made the order."])
 _A1_C2_{"Thinking fast, Imitator rattles off a list of possible names."}
 _A1_C2F_["Imitator stumbles over his words, prompting the guard to speak to the coding team."]
 _A1_3_(["With a guard standing nearby, Pickpocket spots an opportunity to earn their trust."])
 _A1_C3_{"Pickpocket tries to steal the guard&#39;s radio covertly."}
 _A1_C3P_["With a deft move, Pickpocket lifts the radio and gently slides it across the floor."]
 _A1_4_(["Pickpocket tells the guard she&#39;s dropped something, gesturing to the radio."])
 _A1_5_(["Imitator admits there must&#39;ve been a mistake and offers the pizzas for free."])
 _A1_6_(["Having earned her trust, the guard lets the team deliver the pizzas to the developers."])
 _A3_C2P_["Embarrassed by Imitator&#39;s emotional display, the guards let him go."]
 _A4_1_(["The guards point Imitator in the right direction and tell him to leave."])
 _A4_C1F_["The technician sees what Techie is doing and starts interrogating him."]
 _A4_5_(["Techie attempts to brush him off with a stream of jargon-filled gibberish."])
 _A4_C2_{"Techie palms the dongle to Pickpocket while the technician is distracted."}
 _A4_C2F_["Pickpocket drops the wireless device in full view of the technician."]
 _A4_6_(["Spotting a prohibited item, the technician runs off shouting for security."])
 _A4F_(["Unwilling to risk capture, the crew bolts for the fire escape, leaving the servers intact."])
 _A1_C2P_["The guard is persuaded by Imitator&#39;s confidence and lets the crew through."]
 _A3_C1P_["Pickpocket ushers the team through while Imitator delays the security guards."]
 _A4_(["Imitator apologizes for setting off the alarm, claiming she went the wrong way."])
 _A5_C2P_["The virus tunnels through the system&#39;s defenses, granting Hacker access to the codebase."]
 _A6_(["Hacker packages the game engine data and uploads it to an encrypted remote archive."])
 _A6_C1_{"With the code secured, Techie tries to find the write-protect switch."}
 _A6_C1F_["Techie fails to find the switch before the technician starts asking questions."]
 _A6_1_(["When he demands to see some ID, Techie calls in Imitator for assistance."])
 _A6_C2_{"Imitator and Hacker show up to baffle the techie with jargon and waffle."}
 _A6_C2P_["Suitably confused, the technician leaves to find a colleague to back him up."]
 _A8_(["The crew works quickly to locate and destroy as many hard drives as possible."])
 _A8_1_(["By the time he returns, most of the code repository is beyond recovery."])
 _A8S_(["The crew exits via the fire escape, ready to extort a hefty fee for the stolen data."])
 _A2_C1F_["A coder catches Pickpocket and accuses him of groping her."]
 _A2_3_(["Imitator laughs off the accusation while making a hasty exit into the corridor."])
 _A2_C2_{"Passing another employee, Pickpocket tries to discreetly snatch his key fob."}
 _A2_C2P_["Pickpocket bumps into the man and lifts the fob, apologizing profusely for the incident."]
 _A2_5_(["With their route to the servers secured, the pair look for a quiet place to make a call."])
 _A4_C2P_["Pickpocket inserts the dongle into a vacant port on the underside of the patch panel."]
 _A4_7_(["Techie tells the technician to get back to work and let them do their jobs."])
 _A5_C3F_["Imitator overplays it, claiming the system&#39;s firewall has collapsed."]
 _A5_4_(["With his bullshit detector flashing, the technician plays along and steps out to find help."])
 _A5_5_(["While Hacker is setting up a direct link, security personnel swarm the room."])
 _A5F_(["The entire crew is caught red-handed trying to steal the company&#39;s source code."])
 _A6_C1P_["Techie locates the switch and toggles it to disable write protection."]
 _A7_(["Hacker wipes the server clean, leaving no trace of the game&#39;s codebase behind."])
 _A7_1_(["On the way out, Imitator overhears a courier delivering confidential concept art to reception."])
 _A7_C1_{"Imitator detours to intercept the package, hoping to acquire some extra leverage."}
 _A7_C1P_["Imitator signs for the delivery with a smile, as if she was expecting it."]
 _A7_2_(["With more blackmail material acquired, Imitator leads the crew toward the exit."])
 _A7S_(["The team escapes the studio with enough leverage to bleed the company dry."])
 _A5_C1P_["The system is breached, and Hacker begins unlocking the source directories."]
 _B6_C1F_["Hacker hits a wall when the system identifies the operation as a hostile request."]
 _B6_1_(["All project data is locked and the system awaits manual clearance from a verified admin user."])
 _B6F_(["With no way to access the data, the crew has no option but to sneak out empty-handed."])
 _A6_C2F_["They fumble the bluff, and the technician blocks their access to the server."]
 _A6_2_(["Imitator and Pickpocket wrestle him away as he shouts for aid."])
 _A9_(["The others manage to destroy half of the hard drives before his colleagues show up."])
 _A9_1_(["When the development team turns up, the crew is forced to fight their way to the fire exit."])
 _A9_2_(["In the melee, Imitator and Hacker are dogpiled and abandoned."])
 _A9S_(["Even with two teammates left behind, the crew escapes with enough material to extort a vast sum."])
 _A7_C1F_["The receptionist isn&#39;t convinced by Imitator&#39;s story and calls in security."]
 _A7_3_(["The others make a break for the fire exit while Imitator is confronted."])
 _A7S2_(["Despite Imitator&#39;s arrest, the crew escape with enough material to blackmail the game studio."])
 _A3_C3F_["Noticing the attempt, the guard spins and punches Pickpocket with a firm sock to the jaw."]
 _A3_7_(["The other guard calls for backup, and her colleagues come running."])
 _A3F_(["Backed into a corner, the crew gives up and is arrested for trespassing."])
 _A2_C2F_["The employee notices Pickpocket&#39;s clumsy attempt and shoves him to the floor."]
 _A2_4_(["Hearing raised voices, the security guards come rushing over."])
 _A2F_(["Imitator and Pickpocket are detained when their pizza delivery ruse is exposed."])
 _A1_C3F_["The guard grabs Pickpocket by the wrist and twists his arm behind him."]
 _A1F_(["Imitator backs into the elevator, leaving Pickpocket to answer for the attempted theft."])

